<Base title="Privacy"><section class="section page-head editorial"><span class="eyebrow section-kicker">Your information</span><h1>Privacy, plainly.</h1></section><section class="section editorial" style="padding-top:0"><p>Your role preferences stay in memory unless you choose to remember them on this device. If you opt in, this site saves your selected role, visit count, source and tool links you have clicked using local storage.</p><p>The request brief is prepared in your browser. Your name, email and request contents are not saved in local storage or sent to this website’s server. You choose what to share through Stan.</p><h2>External services.</h2><p>Purchases and custom requests are handled through Stan. Writing and subscriptions are hosted on Substack. These services apply their own privacy policies when you visit them. This website does not use third-party analytics.</p><h2>Your choice.</h2><p>You can clear saved website preferences at any time. This does not affect purchases or newsletter subscriptions.</p><button class="button reset-preferences">Reset preferences</button></section></Base>
